{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJYwxp6MXepKuSTnR5GV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The fix is commit `e7052745` (PR #6145), \"TRUNK-6646: Env-var key normalization drops create_database_* / create_user_* credentials in scripted setup.\"** Its author is jwnasambu.\n\n**Root cause:** `normalizeEnvVariableKey` lowercases each environment variable name and turns every `_` into `.`, unless the key is in `NON_NORMALIZED_KEYS`. `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME` was not in that set, so it became `create.database.username`. The filter then looked up `create_database_username`, found nothing, and fell back to root with no password.\n\n**The fix:**\n- `NON_NORMALIZED_KEYS` gains `CREATE_DATABASE_USERNAME`, `CREATE_DATABASE_PASSWORD`, `CREATE_USER_USERNAME`, `CREATE_USER_PASSWORD`, and several other keys (`CONNECTION_DRIVER_CLASS`, `IMPORT_TEST_DATA`, `REMOTE_*`, `ADMIN_PASSWORD_LOCKED`). These keep their underscores.\n- The driver lookup also accepts `connection_driver_class` as a fallback.\n- Import-test-data, remote-server, and admin-password-locked handling were added or adjusted in the same method.\n- New unit tests cover the normalization and the env-to-wizard mapping.\n\nI read the diff, the normalization method, and the env loop. I did not run the test suite.\n\n**Evidence, best first:**\n\n- Commit: `e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e`\n- PR #6145 (from the commit message)\n- Whitelist that the fix extends: `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:198-201`\n- Where the bug happens: `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:1948-1953`\n- Env vars merged into the script properties, normalized per key: `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:340-343`\n- Database username read from the script, with the env key that was being dropped: `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:370-371`\n- Driver-class alias: `openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java:359-360`\n- Normalization unit tests: `openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java:1-92`\n- Env-to-wizard integration tests: `openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java:163-240`\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"commit\": \"e7052745fb78802c8adcd7c1962f3525e7050b1e\"},\n  {\"repo\": \"openmrs-core\", \"pr\": 6145},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 198, \"endLine\": 201},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 1948, \"endLine\": 1953},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 340, \"endLine\": 343},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 370, \"endLine\": 371},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/main/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilter.java\", \"startLine\": 359, \"endLine\": 360},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterNormalizationTest.java\", \"startLine\": 1, \"endLine\": 92},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/web/src/test/java/org/openmrs/web/filter/initialization/InitializationFilterTest.java\", \"startLine\": 163, \"endLine\": 240},\n  {\"ticket\": \"TRUNK-6646\"}\n]\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1663,"cache_read_input_tokens":21457,"cache_creatio